{
  $schema: 'https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json',
  extends: [
    'config:recommended',
    'docker:enableMajor',
    'docker:pinDigests',
    ':disableRateLimiting',
    ':dependencyDashboard',
    ':semanticCommits',
    ':automergeBranch',
  ],
  // Digest pinning comes from the docker:pinDigests preset above, so there is
  // no top-level docker block here. The one it replaced carried
  // `pinDigests: true` and `versioning: 'docker'` under the comment "Force
  // AMD64 architecture for all container pulls", which it never did: Renovate
  // pins the manifest-list digest, not a per-arch manifest. The n8n digest is
  // an application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json covering linux/amd64 and
  // linux/arm64, so every node still resolves its own platform at pull time.
  // Nothing here constrains architecture, and nothing ever did.
  //
  // `versioning: 'docker'` was also the docker datasource default
  // (defaultVersioning = dockerVersioningId), and the block as written
  // migrated to matchCategories: ['docker'], landing after the presets and
  // overriding the preset's deliberate `pinDigests: false` for argocd,
  // devcontainer, helmv3, and pyenv. Only devcontainer exists here, its image
  // is the rolling tag ghcr.io/onedr0p/cluster-template/devcontainer:base,
  // and Renovate has never pinned it, so dropping the block changed nothing
  // observable. If devcontainer digests are ever wanted, ask for them
  // explicitly rather than by reinstating a global override.
  dependencyDashboard: true,
  dependencyDashboardTitle: 'Renovate Dashboard 🤖',
  suppressNotifications: [
    'prEditedNotification',
    'prIgnoreNotification',
  ],
  rebaseWhen: 'conflicted',
  schedule: [
    'every weekend',
  ],
  ignorePaths: [
    '**/*.sops.*',
  ],
  flux: {
    managerFilePatterns: [
      '/(^|/)kubernetes/.+\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
    ],
  },
  'helm-values': {
    managerFilePatterns: [
      '/(^|/)kubernetes/.+\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
    ],
  },
  helmfile: {
    managerFilePatterns: [
      '/(^|/)helmfile\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
    ],
  },
  kubernetes: {
    managerFilePatterns: [
      '/(^|/)kubernetes/.+\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
    ],
  },
  kustomize: {
    managerFilePatterns: [
      '/(^|/)kustomization\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
    ],
  },
  pip_requirements: {
    managerFilePatterns: [
      '/(^|/)[\\w-]*requirements(-\\w+)?\\.(txt|pip)(?:\\.j2)?$/',
    ],
  },
  commitMessageTopic: '{{depName}}',
  commitMessageExtra: 'to {{newVersion}}',
  commitMessageSuffix: '',
  packageRules: [
    {
      description: [
        'Disable digest pinning for OCIRepository resources - they do not support digests',
      ],
      matchManagers: [
        'flux',
      ],
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchFileNames: [
        '**/ocirepository.yaml',
        '**/flux.yaml',
      ],
      pinDigests: false,
    },
    {
      description: [
        'Pin GitHub Actions to a commit SHA and keep the pin current',
      ],
      matchManagers: [
        'github-actions',
      ],
      pinDigests: true,
    },
    {
      description: [
        'Auto merge Github Actions',
      ],
      matchManagers: [
        'github-actions',
      ],
      automerge: true,
      automergeType: 'branch',
      ignoreTests: true,
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'minor',
        'patch',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: [
        'Flux Group',
      ],
      groupName: 'Flux',
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
        'github-tags',
      ],
      versioning: 'semver',
      group: {
        commitMessageTopic: '{{{groupName}}} group',
      },
      separateMinorPatch: true,
      matchPackageNames: [
        '/fluxcd/',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: [
        'Talos Group',
      ],
      groupName: 'Talos',
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      group: {
        commitMessageTopic: '{{{groupName}}} group',
      },
      separateMinorPatch: true,
      matchPackageNames: [
        '/siderolabs/talosctl/',
        '/siderolabs/installer/',
      ],
    },
    {
      description: [
        'Pin emqx-operator to 2.2.x - 2.3.0+ requires EMQX Enterprise 5.9+ with licence for clustering',
      ],
      matchDatasources: [
        'helm',
      ],
      matchPackageNames: [
        'emqx-operator',
      ],
      allowedVersions: '<2.3.0',
    },
    {
      description: [
        'nocodb moved from 0.x to date versioning (0.301.5 -> 2026.04.0 in 2026-04). Renovate 44 added maxMajorIncrement with a default of 500 and treats that as a major jump of 2026, so it silently skipped every release since. Confirmed 2026-11-03 with a local dry-run: "Skipping nocodb/nocodb@2026.10.1 because major increment 2026 exceeds maxMajorIncrement 500". Remove once the pin is on a 2026.x tag.',
      ],
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchPackageNames: [
        'nocodb/nocodb',
      ],
      maxMajorIncrement: 0,
    },
    {
      description: [
        'Hold sonarr on v4 until upstream ships v5 as stable: every v5 release is a prerelease, and v5 migrates the database so a revert means a restore. Remove once v5 is stable.',
      ],
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchPackageNames: [
        'ghcr.io/home-operations/sonarr',
      ],
      allowedVersions: '<5',
    },
    {
      description: [
        'Keep n8n on the stable release line. n8n ships three lines at once: 2.45.x is stable (the stable and latest tags both point at it), 2.46.x is beta (the beta and next tags), and 3.0.x is on no channel at all and has not moved since 2026-10-28 while the other three shipped. Renovate cannot see this, because ignoreUnstable only filters semver prerelease strings and 2.46.3 is clean semver, so without this cap it offers the beta and the major as ordinary updates. n8n also runs DB migrations on upgrade, so a revert is a Postgres restore rather than a rollback. Raise the cap deliberately when 2.46 becomes stable.',
      ],
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchPackageNames: [
        'docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n',
      ],
      allowedVersions: '<2.46',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'helm',
      ],
      commitMessageTopic: 'chart {{depName}}',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      commitMessageTopic: 'image {{depName}}',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'major',
      ],
      commitMessagePrefix: 'feat(container)!: ',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'minor',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'feat',
      semanticCommitScope: 'container',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'patch',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'fix',
      semanticCommitScope: 'container',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'digest',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'chore',
      semanticCommitScope: 'container',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'helm',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'major',
      ],
      commitMessagePrefix: 'feat(helm)!: ',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'helm',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'minor',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'feat',
      semanticCommitScope: 'helm',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'helm',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'patch',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'fix',
      semanticCommitScope: 'helm',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'github-releases',
        'github-tags',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'major',
      ],
      commitMessagePrefix: 'feat(github-release)!: ',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'github-releases',
        'github-tags',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'minor',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'feat',
      semanticCommitScope: 'github-release',
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'github-releases',
        'github-tags',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'patch',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'fix',
      semanticCommitScope: 'github-release',
    },
    {
      matchManagers: [
        'github-actions',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'major',
      ],
      commitMessagePrefix: 'feat(github-action)!: ',
    },
    {
      matchManagers: [
        'github-actions',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'minor',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'feat',
      semanticCommitScope: 'github-action',
    },
    {
      matchManagers: [
        'github-actions',
      ],
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'patch',
      ],
      semanticCommitType: 'fix',
      semanticCommitScope: 'github-action',
    },
    {
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'major',
      ],
      labels: [
        'type/major',
      ],
    },
    {
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'minor',
      ],
      labels: [
        'type/minor',
      ],
    },
    {
      matchUpdateTypes: [
        'patch',
      ],
      labels: [
        'type/patch',
      ],
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'docker',
      ],
      addLabels: [
        'renovate/container',
      ],
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'helm',
      ],
      addLabels: [
        'renovate/helm',
      ],
    },
    {
      matchDatasources: [
        'github-releases',
        'github-tags',
      ],
      addLabels: [
        'renovate/github-release',
      ],
    },
    {
      matchManagers: [
        'github-actions',
      ],
      addLabels: [
        'renovate/github-action',
      ],
    },
  ],
  customManagers: [
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      description: [
        'Process custom dependencies',
      ],
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)kubernetes/.+\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        'datasource=(?<datasource>\\S+) depName=(?<depName>\\S+)( repository=(?<registryUrl>\\S+))?\\n.+: (&\\S+\\s)?(?<currentValue>\\S+)',
      ],
      datasourceTemplate: '{{#if datasource}}{{{datasource}}}{{else}}github-releases{{/if}}',
    },
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      description: [
        'CloudNativePG Cluster imageName - repo:tag combined in one value, unlike the datasource=/depName= comment convention above which needs them split. Confirmed 2026-09-01 this field was invisible to Renovate for the cluster\'s entire lifetime (never touched since the file was first committed, not even a same-version build-string bump) - CNPG\'s imageName key isn\'t the standard "image:" key the default docker/kubernetes managers look for.',
      ],
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)kubernetes/.+\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        'imageName:\\s*(?<depName>[^:\\s]+):(?<currentValue>[^\\s@]+)(@(?<currentDigest>sha256:[a-fA-F0-9]+))?',
      ],
      datasourceTemplate: 'docker',
    },
  ],
}
